diff --git a/docs/analytics.md b/docs/analytics.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..7c1498a461e4415a25cb4dfab6a79192312226f8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/analytics.md
@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+# Analytics contract
+
+Worqai sends only closed, typed conversion properties to Vercel Analytics.
+Résumé content, job descriptions, names, email addresses, session/order IDs,
+raw URLs, referrers, and raw UTM values are excluded.
+
+## Required mount
+
+The locale layout already owns `<Analytics />`. Add the standalone first-touch
+bootstrap beside it; this is the only global integration required:
+
+```tsx
+import { AnalyticsBootstrap } from "@/components/analytics/analytics-bootstrap";
+
+<AnalyticsBootstrap />
+<Analytics />
+```
+
+Without this mount, checkout still captures a safe attribution value, but it
+will describe the checkout page rather than the browser's original landing.
+
+## Event semantics
+
+- `audit_start`: the API accepted the request, not merely a file selection.
+- `audit_complete`: polling observed the authoritative `audited` status.
+- `signup_complete`: the fresh-account welcome page observed an authenticated user.
+- `tailor_complete`: polling observed the authoritative `tailored` status.
+- `checkout_start`: Polar created a checkout session successfully.
+- `purchase`: a verified Polar `order.paid` webhook was durably inserted.
+
+Apply `scripts/migrations/2026-07-13-marketing-conversions.sql` before deploying
+the webhook changes.
+
